#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:189
msgid "This also works on type and module declarations:"
msgstr "これは型宣言やモジュール宣言にも使用できます:"

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:212
msgid ""
"Inserts a `/** ... */` documentation comment stub above the current "
"declaration. For function declarations, `@param` tags are automatically "
"generated for each parameter."
msgstr ""
"現在の宣言の上に `/** ... */` ドキュメントコメントのスタブを挿入します。関数宣言の場合、各パラメーターに対して `@param` "
"タグが自動的に生成されます。"

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:214
msgid ""
"The intention is available on `let`, `type`, `module`, `external`, and "
"`exception` declarations that do not already have a doc comment."
msgstr ""
"このインテンションは、まだドキュメントコメントが付与されていない "
"`let`、`type`、`module`、`external`、`exception` 宣言で利用可能です。"

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:222
msgid "**After** (invoke \"Generate doc comment\"):"
msgstr "**実行後**（\"Generate doc comment\" を実行）:"

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:233
msgid "Pipe ⇔ Function Call Conversion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:235
msgid ""
"Convert between pipe-first syntax and regular function call syntax. Place"
" the caret on a pipe expression or function call and press `Alt+Enter`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/features/code-editing.md:237
